\f0\fs24 \cf0 # Section 5 Figures and Data\
\
This folder contains the **figures** and **data** used in Section 5 of the paper.  \
Specifically, it includes:\
\
- `fig24`, `fig26`, `fig28`, and `fig30` plot images  \
- Raw data used to generate these figures  \
- Python scripts to regenerate figures from data  \
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56615  How to Generate Figures\
\
To generate the figures from data, run the following commands from within the `Section5/` folder:\
\
```bash\
python Newapp_alldata.py 1\
```\
This will generate **Figure 24**.\
\
```bash\
python Newapp_alldata.py 2\
```\
This will generate **Figure 26a**.\
\
```bash\
python Newapp_alldata.py 3\
```\
This will generate **Figure 26b**.\
\
```bash\
python Newapp_alldata.py 4\
```\
This will generate **Figure 27a**.\
\
```bash\
python Newapp_alldata.py 5\
```\
This will generate **Figure 27b**.\
\
```bash\
python Newapp_alldata.py 6\
```\
This will generate **Figure 30a** and **Figure 30b**.\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56550  Notes\
\
- Please make sure the required dependencies (e.g., `matplotlib`, `numpy`, `pandas`) are installed.\
- The script takes a numeric argument (e.g., `1`, `2`, etc.) to select which figure to generate.\
- All outputs are saved in the same folder unless otherwise specified in the script.\
\
